{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:efb1bd80986f89a4e768f9a2333c5877acb789cf45eb7b922ddf456e1e1afa7d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8c280c6831976f523502274a16ecba33a98216bbeaede18ee8a1da3e4c76a",
      "text": "黑影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7bd58394001c08d4b7f81229738ca096d837e11951f5da5bfcfda74720834b",
      "text": "在JIF献上火热舞台表演的\n315 Production偶像们。\n全场被热烈的气氛所包围，\n然而，却有一名形迹可疑的男子正满脸不悦地\n注视着他们的活跃身姿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000021:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000021:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8c280c6831976f523502274a16ecba33a98216bbeaede18ee8a1da3e4c76a",
      "text": "黑影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c26732e22efa354733f443a75af1ec42866eec65e59801d50fe93d86861efe7",
      "text": "各位，今天谢谢大家来到JIF！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc769ba59815fa7445484fde181ceaed3fa809ef04d47add8d74fe5821b2bc80",
      "text": "我们315 Pro以“顶尖偶像”为目标，\n今后也会继续努力！请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ad8ec73c97b1864187d82a28658de4df2f65176cfd81bcf0522af46cf8e367d",
      "text": "哼，明明不过是个资历尚浅的嫩头青事务所……\n说什么“顶尖偶像”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989987b7cae579ff0ab748fd93bdeddf0cd6be53fa031c043bce00db52304876",
      "text": "那到底是怎样的存在，\n你们真的能想象得出来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49e4393cf1e86d59f8d18353e94a881d381b94f61f37a19cf62cefa5c1ad7ef6",
      "text": "不就只是漫无目的地，\n追逐着模糊虚幻的幻影罢了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000261:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d706e4357b7dbab05c5014a5228ef501216c28af2380a33ac56cb265bf90ba",
      "text": "……真是叫人不爽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000263:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0db72dec83ba6c9835a412b6d1fbf70bc546c51603a390f64c7676ac5b15b83",
      "text": "再好好看个清楚，究竟谁才最接近“顶点”？\n以及，到底是哪家事务所？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000266:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ab6be0c38bdf3e89501c7726594133a852796d9389325d1a84ce3198248b5ce",
      "text": "举办一场比拼偶像力的锦标赛，\n用肉眼可见的形式分个高下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46b360fe20c08554e97af25cee2bb9b4fee4c5619eb844a2b344f375d83104d0",
      "text": "太棒了！只要您一声令下，\n众多企业都会施以援手的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1423bcde8c71db510c12f2f2667a4a1512a894b5920369401673b50c07562f8a",
      "text": "嘛，就算举办了大赛，\n第一名肯定也还是我们事务所就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d70e5a2552ca2d3f5621bbd64b44450d30aca1e04d2bb0be34e62e8e2c38bd",
      "text": "毕竟再怎么说，我们可是\n无人不知的大型偶像事务所啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb40eeab9eb1f79fadae83ce8d146dc4e7c1ccd2e0149a0ec461f199f66301d2",
      "text": "这是理所当然的。\n315 Production之流，根本不值一提。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fced9a0808b902904bec07088c7d84fba68af54d43adbafd402b81711114cead",
      "text": "感谢各位的应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a54428568097018387bff3a1df3f6de7b04eadf2c81558b8f43799e3f1240942",
      "text": "JIF才刚刚开始。\n请大家尽情享受到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:602defbee646f9a3fdb8d7e1462c58a3f92f89c793956c2091c5809c475c3731",
      "text": "……哼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0936be5bab77e27e32557f5cddfedafb5dd6c9d1e13996d2ae8005f0c7da80e7",
      "text": "（最近虽然风头挺劲，不过你们的\n好运也到此为止了。一定要让你们好看！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a8c88ba3403cce41a21dc1b5dd95d7baeef33d78c51473dc76a3f322fa5bba",
      "text": "立刻准备纸和笔！\n由我亲自去邀请那些家伙参加大赛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dcc41058183e933bd5a739e063e6c4fc7b6a9c32d9059192bb93474a64102f6",
      "text": "（洗干净脖子等着吧，315 Production！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
